      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Solar Today installed the system without permission from powercore, only ever submitted the pre approval and never followed up the technical requirements with powercore. Told us better off to not connect to the grid because we could get a better deal with the power providers, salesman said he would come back and make sure we had the best possible deal with a provider but never showed. Salesman told us nothing was being fed into the grid but our smart meter said otherwise, powercore confirmed they hadn't held up on there end of the deal. We have been left with a system feeding into the grid with no feed in Tarif to us. It's been 7 months but Solar Today have done nothing to rectify the problem",
