      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I purchased my 4kw system from solar today.  In hindsight, if I was to purchase another system I would do more homework, as I felt I could have done better price wise and quality wise  if I had  have taken more time. I was into in the market to buy a system, it just so happened that a salesperson from this company was canvassing my area. I felt as though I was somewhat pressured in to the purchase. It is a month now, and my system has not yet been inspected, nor am I getting paid for power that is being pumped into the grid. I am not blaming the company, but the independent inspector. I feel better now that I have had a wee whinge. Gerry",
